==English==
{{wp}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|en|tutour||archaic}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|tutour}}, from {{der|en|fro|tuteur}} ({{cog|fr|tuteur}}), from {{der|en|la|tūtor||a watcher, protector, guardian}}, from {{m|la|tueor|t=protect}}; see [[tuition]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|en|non-rhotic}}
** {{a|en|RP}}
